  <data key="d26">If we execute it from a path which is not final or the expected by the malware, it replicates to another path and executes from there, which is something it does have in common with some PlugX dll loaders: ! [] (https:// lab52. io/blog/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/01. png) Once executed, we observe how the netsh.exe process tries to establish connections with port 443 of the IP address 31.192.107 .</data>
