  <data key="d26">In fact, in July 2020 Researchers from Kaspersky reported on [Iran-linked threat actor group * APT34 *] (https:// quointelligence.eu/2020/12/cyber-security-trends-in-2021 /) (also known as * OilRig *) evolving tactics using DNS-over-HTTPS (DoH) as a channel for data exfiltration through an open-source tool.</data>
