  <data key="d26">Netwalker has been tied to 143 ransomware incidents in 2020. * * REvil * * One of the most ubiquitous ransomware variants on the market, deployments of REvil first were observed on April 17, 2019, where attackers leveraged a vulnerability in Oracle WebLogic servers tracked as CVE-2019-2725.</data>
